  "details": "Ability to adjust the proximity of a pick-up object.  Currently it appears that the proximity adjustment only works for items that are static, and do not have pickup enabled.  Having this function, would allow for greater control and less mistakenly grabbed objects in game, if there were a way to adjust this.  Particularly useful for 'game' type worlds, or where objects are being used to control world elements (sliders etc)",
